title: Anti-Ukrainian patrol rhetoric enters local politics
face-image: img/poland/events/grzegorz-braun-2025.webp
new-page: true
view-if: november_2022_konf_done = 0
on-arrival: november_2022_konf_done = 1; anti_ukrainian_pressure += 2; far_right_agenda += 1; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += -7; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 8; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 8

= November 2022 — The same channels, sharper enemies

Accounts that grew during pandemic and anti-abortion mobilisation now circulate
lists of "unsafe" schools, shelters and border towns allegedly "captured by
Ukrainians and the left." Konfederacja's formal spokespeople keep legal distance,
while local sympathisers test patrol and "self-defence" rhetoric that can turn
one rumour into a street confrontation.

- @nov22_konf_preempt
- @nov22_konf_record
- @nov22_konf_shrug

@nov22_konf_preempt
title: Build joint town-security and anti-vigilante protocols
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The municipal and legal teams cannot run the protocol.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; anti_ukrainian_pressure -= 3; minority_safety += 4; police_trust += 2; local_network += 2; public_trust += 2; news_headline = "Town protocols isolate vigilante rhetoric before it spills into violence"

Lewica mayors, police liaison officers and refugee organisations publish one
rule: border security belongs to state services, not partisan patrols. The rule
does not eliminate hostility, but it narrows where it can claim legitimacy.

- @nov22_return: Return to the November desk

@nov22_konf_record
title: Document and prosecute intimidation incidents case by case
on-arrival: media_capacity += 2; constitutional_restraint += 2; anti_ukrainian_pressure -= 1; minority_safety += 2; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "Lewica answers patrol rhetoric with evidence and prosecutions"

The party prioritises legal evidence, named incidents and prosecution support.
It is slower than rally rhetoric and harder to fake once cases reach court.

- @nov22_return: Return to the November desk

@nov22_konf_shrug
title: Treat it as fringe posturing
on-arrival: anti_ukrainian_pressure += 5; minority_safety -= 3; konf_poll_momentum += 0.2; far_right_street_capacity += 2; news_headline = "Local vigilante language expands faster than institutional response"

What looked like fringe bravado becomes a recurring local story: threatened
volunteers, tense school meetings and evening patrol rumours that authorities
must answer after they spread.

- @nov22_return: Return to the November desk

@nov22_return
