@nov22_finish
title: Close the November desk
view-if: independence_2022_done = 1 and przewodow_2022_done = 1 and november_2022_konf_done = 1
on-arrival: november_2022_done = 1

A missile fell on a Polish village and the country spent an evening deciding
whether it had been attacked. The march came and went. The patrol rhetoric
stayed. November closes with the war standing closer to the border than the
political system had budgeted for.

- @poland_hub: Continue


